   "source": [
    "### Step 6: Summary and Recommendations\n",
    "\n",
    "The rotate_joint command benefited the most from optimization because it initially had the slowest response time.\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Example:\n",
    "**Identified Issue:** The rotate_joint command showed the highest response time compared to the other robotic arm commands, indicating higher latency in the control process.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Optimization Applied:** A simulated optimization reducing execution time by 20% was applied to all commands. After optimization, the response times improved significantly   "\n",
    "**Next Steps:**\n",
    "- Further improvements could include reducing redundant calculations.\n",
    "- Improving motor communication efficiency, and performing stress tests under higher workloads to validate system stability.\n"
